  "releaseNotes": "Added:\n* New AssetHandler / IAssetHandler exposing asset upload and WaitReady APIs;\n* Mockable handler interfaces: ICatalogHandler, IClientHandler,\nIFormDefinitionHandler, IFormHandler, IGroupPortalHandler,\nISecretManager.\nChanged:\n* Refactored AdfsHelper, CatalogHandler, ClientHandler,\nFormDefinitionHandler, FormHandler, GroupPortalHandler, and\nSecretManager to use the new interfaces and improve internal structure.\n* Rebuilt and significantly expanded XML documentation\n(HybridForms.AppApiClient.xml).\nFixed:\n* Corrected GroupPortalHandler REST routes in IHybridFormsAppApi to match\nthe server-side AppController endpoints.",
